
---

# 🧾 .gitignore（与你现有规则一致，略微补充）
你前面那份已经很好了，这里是**最终版**（如已覆盖，可保持不变）：

```gitignore
# ===== Secrets =====
.env
*.env
backend/.env
!backend/.env.sample
frontend/node_modules/
backend/tools/probe/*.wav

# ===== User config =====
config.json
frontend/config.js

# ===== Portable data (keep structure, ignore content) =====
LunaData/*
!LunaData/.gitkeep
!LunaData/audio/.gitkeep
!LunaData/diary/.gitkeep
!LunaData/logs/.gitkeep

# ===== Models =====
LunaModels/**
models_config.json
backend/audio/
backend/state.json
backend/settings.json

# ===== Logs / caches =====
*.log
logs/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# ===== Node / build =====
node_modules/
dist/
build/
frontend/.cache/
dist_electron/

# ===== IDE / OS =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# ===== Packaging outputs =====
Luna_Portable/
Luna_Full_v0.6.1/
*.zip
*.spec

# ===== Local launchers =====
Start.bat

# ===== Temp & envs =====
LunaData/**/tmp/
LunaData/**/cache/
*.bak
.venv/
env/
.packenv/
.pack_xtts_gpu/
